<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/4c75adad-4e33-4388-9dba-3fe1e3a97659> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "As a FAIR-enabling resource, ADVANCE's form is machine-actionable and follows domain-relevant community standards. Its aim is to comprehensively describe data from terrestrial, freshwater and marine ecosystems, and so allow their integration and reuse." ;
