<https://id.dalia.education/learning-resource/b927e0df-5366-4558-aa4a-76d577f376b8> a ec:EducationalResource ;
    bflr:supportinghost dalia-community:4f646323-756e-41d0-bdb6-0767411a14b5 ;
    dcterms:description "This guide demonstrates how to model metadata for research processes and resulting datasets in engineering with the ontology Metadata4Ing 1.2.1. The guide will enable you to create machine-understandable metadata for your own research data, following Semantic Web standards like RDF, RDFS, OWL, and JSON-LD." ;
